&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🦄 DataDome&lt;/strong&gt; delivers real-time bot and agent trust management, enabling businesses to trust the intent behind their traffic—human, bot, or AI agent. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot And Agent Trust Management Q2 2026, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome&#39;s multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily, analyzing the intent of every session so only trusted traffic reaches your business — powering growth across your sites, apps, APIs, and MCP servers. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 35+ global PoPs, and 80+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering traffic you can trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Dashboard technical stack is mainly composed of ElasticSearch &amp;amp; MariaDB for the storage, Symfony 8 &amp;amp; Angular 21. Our infrastructure is deployed on AWS, GCP and Azure, using Docker, Ansible and Terraform, and monitored with Grafana, Prometheus &amp;amp; DataDog. We&#39;re also heavily invested in integrating AI into our engineering workflows, and expect the same from anyone joining the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Dashboard team is currently composed of a mixture Fullstack, Backend &amp;amp; Frontend engineers, and is looking for a Frontend-strong engineer to help us design and develop our current product. Some of our best engineers started specialized and grew into full-stack over time — if that&#39;s a path you want, the team supports it, but there&#39;s no expectation to do so.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be more specifically in charge of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing new features in our customer dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the frontend performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finding and fixing bug reports from our Q/A process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and fixing production bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning and evaluating the issues to work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AI tools as part of your day-to-day engineering workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning topics you want to push forward — from idea to delivery, with real autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging directly with stakeholders to shape and defend your proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re the perfect candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have been building applications for 4+ years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong, hands-on experience with Angular 17 or newer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable using AI-assisted tools to speed up and improve your engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about code quality, simplicity and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your growth path:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you want to, you can grow into full-stack over time — picking up Symfony/PHP with support from the team, at your own pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is entirely optional and up to you: staying and deepening your frontend expertise is just as valid a path here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whichever direction you choose becomes part of your ongoing career path conversations — and for the right person, motivated and driven, there&#39;s real room to grow further, whether that&#39;s deepening technical expertise or moving into a leadership role as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Symfony or another PHP framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked at high scale with systems like MariaDB, Redis or ElasticSearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You wrote your own crawler once or twice before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how internet works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in a scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life:&lt;/strong&gt; While we offer remote, hybrid, &amp;amp; in-office options each position specifies the level of flexibility. Our Parisian office is located next to the Opera Garnier. You will also receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace if you work hybrid or remotely.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are full remote, the SNCF dicount card is paid for you to come to our office to visit us &amp;amp; your team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We have partnered with Kenko for your healthcare needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allowance of €200 if you come to the office by bike to cover maintenance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;: #Weaimhigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Team building: #We care and we have fun!&lt;/strong&gt; We organise ****Annual Company-Offsite, Events, Drinks, Winter Party, Lunch &amp;amp; Learns and much more are part of our Culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on the country you are based from (e.g. 25 days in France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Talent Acquisition Manager : first interview and cultural fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Engineering Manager : technical and cultural fit + Take-home technical challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Team: Presentation and review of your &quot;technical proposal&quot; with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Member of the leadership team - Discussion about DataDome vision and &quot;raison d&#39;être&quot;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Now you really met everyone! Welcome to DataDome :)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DataDome is an equal opportunity employer, and is proud to be committed to diversity and inclusiveness. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability, or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Hims &amp;amp; Hers grows internationally, the complexity of our business, organisation and leadership needs is growing with it. We’re looking for a Director of People Partnering, EMEA to help build the leadership and talent, and strengthen the organisation, for what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll work with senior leaders on the critical people and organisational decisions needed to drive the next phase of our international growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll start with the business problem, bring an independent point of view, and help leaders translate business strategy into the organisation, leadership and talent decisions required to support growth and performance. You’ll shape strategy with senior leaders while staying close enough to the business to turn decisions into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading and developing a high-performing People Partnering team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop a team of People Partners and People Advisers, building the capability and judgment needed to support an increasingly complex business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for what excellent People Partnering looks like, building a team that is commercially sharp, exercises strong judgment and is trusted by the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity around roles, priorities and ownership across the team, focusing support where it can have the greatest impact as the business grows and evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring senior-level judgment to complex and sensitive people matters within the team’s client groups, working with Employment Legal and local experts where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving business strategy through people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with senior leaders to understand their priorities and determine what they mean for the organisation, leadership and talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the business — what drives growth, where the organisation is getting in its own way, and where changes to structure, talent or leadership will have the greatest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead organisational design and workforce planning, helping leaders make clear, data-informed decisions about structure, roles, capabilities, spans and layers as the business grows and evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring regional business and talent needs into the global People agenda, while helping translate global priorities into approaches that work effectively across local markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthening leadership and talent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach senior leaders to strengthen their effectiveness and that of their leadership teams, bringing an independent point of view when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build leadership capability by helping leaders set a high bar, give clear feedback, manage performance, make strong talent decisions and build increasingly effective teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar on talent — identifying and developing critical talent, addressing performance gaps, strengthening succession, and ensuring we have the leadership and capabilities the business needs as it grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help senior leaders navigate periods of significant change, bringing clarity to complex organisational and talent decisions and anticipating the downstream impact on teams, leaders and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping the People Partnering agenda&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the direction and priorities for People Partnering across the region, focusing the team on the highest-impact business, organisation and talent needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use people data, business context and what you’re hearing across the organisation to identify patterns, anticipate risks, surface opportunities leaders may not yet see, and turn those insights into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the broader People team to solve business problems end to end, bringing together the right expertise across People Partnering, Talent Acquisition, Total Rewards and People Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful tradeoffs about where the People Partnering team focuses, balancing immediate business needs with longer-term organisation and talent priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience operating as a senior People Partner or HRBP in complex, high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of working directly with senior executives and influencing important decisions about organisation, leadership, workforce and talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading organisation design, workforce planning, leadership development, talent strategy and meaningful organisational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to quickly understand business priorities and translate complex challenges into practical organisation and talent solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The credibility and confidence to bring an independent point of view, challenge assumptions and influence senior leaders when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing People Partnering or HR advisory teams, setting a high bar and building strong, independent partners to the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of UK employment law and experience operating across multiple jurisdictions, with the judgment to navigate complex employee matters and know when to engage Employment Legal or local expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to anticipate organisational issues, connect patterns across the business and proactively solve problems before they slow the organisation down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder’s mindset, with a track record of creating scalable approaches that improve how organisations operate as they grow and evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to move seamlessly between long-term strategy and hands-on execution — comfortable going deep when the situation requires it and moving quickly when it doesn’t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.compound.co/&quot;&gt;Compound&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, skincare, and preventative health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Dexory, we&#39;re developing advanced software powered by cutting-edge robots that are transforming the very face of global logistics. With infectious enthusiasm, our unique blend of disciplines work in harmony to produce results at pace. From hardware and manufacturing to software, AI and commercial, we&#39;re one team – one heart – that beats, learns and grows together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take your customer analysis out of the dashboard and onto the warehouse floor.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior Customer Analyst &lt;/strong&gt;you already know how to find the story in customer data: segments, drivers of churn, usage patterns, voice-of-customer signals. Here, you&#39;ll pair that with what you see first-hand in live warehouses, then use both to decide which product bets Dexory makes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to the &quot;why&quot; behind the numbers.&lt;/strong&gt; Run contextual inquiry, operator and manager interviews, surveys, card sorts, and prototype and usability tests across every stage of deployment and every persona.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check site behaviour against behaviour at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Combine what you observe on site with Pendo and DexoryView usage data, so no insight rests on one warehouse or one dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validate or kill ideas quickly.&lt;/strong&gt; Pressure-test concepts with A/B tests, prototype tests and interviews, and tell the team whether a bet solves a real problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close the loop after go-live.&lt;/strong&gt; Log structured operator and site-manager feedback, pass it to the PM, and keep it in the research repository.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size the opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt; Support market sizing and competitive mapping for specific themes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn findings into decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; Write clear, presentation-ready syntheses and share them through Notion and Slack, internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the insight machinery.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain SurveyMonkey dashboards, co-maintain the research insights pipeline, and feed capacity and progress data into the shared operating dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape how we work with AI.&lt;/strong&gt; Co-design the AI enablement playbook for research, covering workflows, prompts, guardrails, and what stays human-only versus human-in-the-loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Give the user a voice.&lt;/strong&gt; Co-develop UX content with the Lead and Commercial team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years in research, qual/quant insight, or product/bet design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in qualitative and quantitative methods, and the judgement to know which one a question needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, from open question through to early product bet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with tools like Notion, SurveyMonkey, Slack, Pendo and Basecamp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal synthesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field experience in warehouses, logistics, manufacturing, healthcare operations or similar, and comfort on a warehouse floor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX content skills, including capturing the voice of the user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*We value the right attitude, humility and we&#39;re as interested in your character as we are in your talent. Please apply, even if you feel you only meet part of our listed criteria. Diversity drives innovation and we offer an international and friendly work environment with an energetic company culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting from the interview process and continuing into your career with us, you will be working by our four Operating Principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, outstanding results,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Big challenges, bigger results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment:&lt;/strong&gt; All in, every time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One team:&lt;/strong&gt; One mission, shared success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Dexory isn’t just about having expertise… it’s about embracing uncertainty with purpose. You’ll&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;help define not only our products, but the future of autonomous logistics itself. From day one, you’ll be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;trusted to push boundaries, take ownership, and deliver breakthrough results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare via Bupa with 24/7 medical helpline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension: 4+% employee with option to opt into salary exchange, 5% employer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme - mental wellbeing, financial and legal advice/support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 holidays per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full meals onsite in Wallingford&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun team events on and offsite, snacks of all kinds in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
