&lt;li&gt;Analyse large and complex datasets from cryptocurrency exchanges, DeFi protocols, and financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, test, and improve models, signals, and algorithms that support trading strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with IMC’s cutting-edge data, software, and high-performance computing infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with researchers, developers, and engineers to turn research into production-ready strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn how to evaluate trading opportunities with a focus on performance, scalability, robustness, and risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
